      "widgets_values": [
        "Google Flow through the useapi.net API (third-party, not affiliated with Google).\n\nBefore you queue:\n1. Get a useapi.net API token: https://useapi.net/docs/start-here/setup-useapi?utm_source=comfyui&utm_medium=workflow\n2. Connect your Google account once: https://useapi.net/docs/start-here/setup-google-flow?utm_source=comfyui&utm_medium=workflow\n3. Set USEAPI_TOKEN before starting ComfyUI, or put the token in ComfyUI/user/useapi_token.txt.\n\nNano Banana image edit: load any image, describe the change. Up to 10 reference images (batch them). Models: Nano Banana 2 Lite, Nano Banana 2.1 (nano-banana-2), Nano Banana Pro."
